                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_UGEmqm": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Dry skin can feel tight throughout the day, and may experience noticeable flaking. Dry skin is largely due to genetics, environmental factors such as lifestyle & diet, hormonal changes, andclimate.</p><p>Daily exfoliation with gentle ingredients help promote skin cell turnover without removing skin’s natural oils. The best moisturizers for dry skin are those containing hyaluronic acid, glycerin, and marine actives like algae, because of their ability to attract water and deliver it directly to skin cells.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
