                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_7xHnri": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Excess oil can oftentimes leave pores congested and clogged. The happy news however is that oily skin looks younger and more supple because it has more natural moisture and is lessprone to wrinkle. Daily enzymatic exfoliation is essential to promote cell turnover and prevent sebum buildup in pores.</p>",
